# Third-party notices

The generated Claude package can include the shared OpenSocrates bundled onedir
runtime. The Claude selector itself invokes the user's existing Claude Code CLI
and adds no Anthropic SDK dependency. The shared runtime also includes the
locked `openai-codex` 0.144.4 and
`openai-codex-cli-bin` 0.144.4 packages, Pydantic, and their transitive/native
dependency closure, in addition to Python standard-library code.

For the exact dependency inventory and terms, consult the accompanying release
SBOM and the license files bundled with the runtime where provided.

